    </div></div><div class='html-p'>The vehicle model derived in <a href="#sec3-actuators-13-00164" class="html-sec">Section 3</a> serves as a dynamic constraint for the MPC. The discretized linear model is employed within the prediction horizon to delineate the dynamic constraint, presented as follows:<div class='html-disp-formula-info' id='FD25-actuators-13-00164'>
